        <h2 class="section-title">Four steps to your first managed agent</h2>
        <p class="section-desc" style="margin-top:16px">
          Remote hosts need only tmux and an SSH account — AgentMux can install tmux where it's
          missing. This computer is even simpler: no credentials at all.
        </p>
        <a class="quick-cta" href="docs-en.html">Read the full docs<span class="arrow">→</span></a>
