        <li class="quick-step reveal">
          <div class="quick-step-idx">1</div>
          <div><h3>Add a host</h3><p>Remote: address, user, and one of ssh-agent / key / password, with jump hosts supported. Local: nothing but a name.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li class="quick-step reveal">
          <div class="quick-step-idx">2</div>
          <div><h3>Add a project and workspace</h3><p>A working directory on that host. Or browse the host's files and add the directory in place — its name, path, and host are already known.</p></div>
