        <li class="quick-step reveal">
          <div class="quick-step-idx">4</div>
          <div><h3>⌃K opens the command palette</h3><p>Attaching to an agent, opening a shell, installing a CLI, changing theme — the fastest route to all of it.</p><code>Ctrl / ⌘ + K</code></div>
